window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After growing far stronger throughout her time on Tartarus, Scarlet is finally ready to move on. To return to Earth. And to finally join the war between the humans and demons.</p> <p>But first she has to figure out how to return home. And to do that, she may have to take up a Demon Lord's offer.</p> <p>Will she be able to return and join the war?</p> <p>Or will she remain stuck on Tartarus?</p> <p><b>About the series: When a Demonic Assault occurs, most people stuck inside of a Fracture end up hiding inside of a bunker in the hopes that they don’t get killed by a demon. Others might even hope for the slightest possible chance at signing a contract with a spirit and becoming a Guardian. So when Scarlet was caught in a Fracture, the last thing she expected was to become a demon herself. Join her as she learns about her nature as a half demon, grows stronger, and figures out who exactly she is.</b></p>"; 
